{offset150}{arial}Nefertiti Transmission
Message NEF-1015
Operator: Corporal Fricks

{offset0}from: {arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}
General Headquarters of Kapharna
 
to: {arialbld}{name}{arial}
Fort Guardaia



I've got good news and bad news for you.

Let's start with the good news: Our traditional allies, the Federation of Schyzo States, have arrived at Fez in the east with reinforcements and artillery, they are lead by Kurt Rorscham. You will need to contact him and coordinate your actions. 

The bad news came early this morning, Guardaia has been bombarded with fire bombs. The town is on fire, and there's total panic.  

Kurt Rorscham has at your disposal a fire fighting unit, you must take control of it at Fez at bring it back to Guardaia before the town turns into a pile of ashes. 













{center}{device3}














Don't get up yet {name}, we just received a message concerning you from Karlo Von Tekton himself. To make a long story short, he promises to promptly send us by mail the different parts of your body in a series of small parcels. Our psychologists believe he does not like you much since his defeat at Rabat!

At Guardaia you can start production of our new tank, which is faster and more powerful (see below). 















{center}{device9}















One second {name} that's not all, I was about to forget the second piece of bad news, hmm!

Aerial photographs clearly show us the presence of three heavy Psycho tanks in the sector.

So be on your guard and try to return to us in one piece...



{offset150}{arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}

Grand Commander of the Normo Army 




{offset200}{signature1}{offset0}


{}
